对于命题(3), $\because f\left(\frac{\pi}{2}-x\right)=\sin \left(\frac{\pi}{2}-x\right)+\frac{1}{\sin \left(\frac{\pi}{2}-x\right)}=\cos x+\frac{1}{\cos x}$,

